Gwendolen: Hello, new attendant and welcome to Pendragon & Kin!
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: I’m very busy with research, so I will keep this short.  
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Since the vampires enjoy sending us dangerous scrolls, I trust that you sort those out from my regular mail. 
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: My old assistant gathered all the information you need to do so. He said he left it all on your desk.
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Good luck.
<<end_of_response>>
