---
<<if change_person("Thisle", "Happy")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: Good morning, attendant! 
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: As it’s your first day here, I promised the others in Arcane Communication that I’d tell you about the stamps on your desk.
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: You see, there have been a few incidents with seal thefts and dangerous spells originating from scrolls lately.
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: If you see anything concerning, please fill out the checklist with whatever suspicious signs you find, and seal the scroll with the stamp marked with a fish.
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: I’ll collect those scrolls for our department at the end of the day, ok?
<<trigger_talk>>
Thistle: See ya!
<<end_of_it>>
===


